  "description": "Non-material amendment (removal of condition 5 relating to 9th floor (northern side) as ancillary C3 floorspace) of Full Planning Permission reference 17/4242 dated 11 December, 2017, for:Change of use of the Class B1 ground floor entrance foyer, accessed from the London Design Outlet, to a Class C3 residential entrance lobby; Change of use of part ninth floor (northern side) from Class D1 to ancillary Class C3 floorspace to provide a 'co-working' space for residents of the building;Replacement of existing fenestration, including the introduction of additional glazed units in place of existing louvre panels; and Provision of additional covered and secure residential cycle storage capacity external to York House.",
